# Video Game Sales Data Analysis & Visualization

This project analyses a dataset of popular video games using Python, Pandas, and Matplotlib. The dataset contains information about game titles, platforms, release years, genres, publishers, regional sales, and global sales.

## Project Objectives

* Explore and understand video game sales data
* Identify the best-selling games and genres
* Analyse global and regional sales patterns
* Examine the relationship between platforms, genres, publishers, and sales
* Create clear and informative data visualisations

## Dataset Features

The dataset includes:

* Game Name
* Platform
* Release Year
* Genre
* Publisher
* North American Sales
* European Sales
* Japanese Sales
* Other Regional Sales
* Global Sales

## Technologies Used

* Python
* Pandas
* Matplotlib
* Jupyter Notebook / Google Colab

## Visualisations

The project includes several visualisations, such as:

1. Global sales comparison
2. Sales by genre
3. Sales by platform
4. Regional sales analysis
5. Top-selling video games
6. Publisher performance

## Key Purpose

The main purpose of this project is to demonstrate practical data analysis and visualisation skills by transforming a real-world video game dataset into meaningful insights using Python.

## Skills Demonstrated

* Data cleaning
* Exploratory Data Analysis (EDA)
* Data aggregation
* Data interpretation
* Statistical analysis
* Data visualisation
* Python programming

